  "body": "Your Gulf Harbour Sanctuary Awaits!\r\n\r\nWelcome to 256 Alec Craig Way, an exceptional freehold home beautifully positioned in a highly desirable pocket of Gulf Harbour. Perfectly designed for modern, effortless living, this elevated 2000s residence blends comfort, style, and convenience on an easy-care 302m² section.\r\n\r\nAs soon as you enter the home from the sunny, fully fenced courtyard, you know you are home. The kitchen acts as the true hub of the open living area, which extends seamlessly out to a lovely glassed deck - the perfect setting for late afternoon drinks while taking in the beautiful, relaxing views of the marina and harbour.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the home offers a spacious and efficient layout with all three bedrooms conveniently located on one level, adding a reassuring feeling of security and peace of mind for the whole family. This upper level features the two family bedrooms plus a generous master suite, along with a full bathroom and a private ensuite. Throughout the home, you will find plenty of practical storage to easily accommodate busy family life.\r\n\r\nDown on the lower level, a spacious double garage provides secure parking for two vehicles along with the ultimate convenience of direct internal access. Step outside, and you will also find a handy little wooden utility structure on-site, perfect for keeping a small trailer or extra outdoor equipment neatly covered and protected.\r\n\r\nWhether you are looking for a secure family home close to local amenities or a solid addition to your investment portfolio, this property ticks all the right boxes. Don't miss the opportunity to secure your spot in this prime coastal location!\r\n\r\nCall for a viewing now.",
